{"kode":"ASLC","sumber":"Stockbit profile","dipanen_pada":"2026-08-23","address":[{"id":"1000003550","email":["corporate.secretary@autopedia.id"],"fax":"N/A","npwp":"0033462417045000","phone":"(021) 50862055","website":"www.autopedia.id","key":"","lastupdate":"2024-05-22T15:35:21+07:00","value":"","office":"Kuningan City Lt. UG 56 Jl. Prof Dr. Satrio No. Kav 18, Jakarta Selatan 12940"}],"background":"PT Autopedia Sukses Lestari (ASLC) merupakan wadah dari berbagai bidang usaha yang berhubungan dengan otomotif. Mulai dari lelang mobil dan motor, jual beli mobil online, dan penyedia data harga mobil dan motor. ASLC akan terus berkembang dengan beberapa layanan baru yang akan diperkenalkan di kemudian hari.\r\n\r\nMelihat sejarahnya, pada pertengahan tahun 2014 ASLC mendirikan lelang mobil (car auction) BIDWIN yang berlokasi di Tipar Cakung, Jakarta. Lelang mobil ini terus berkembang hingga dengan lokasi tersebar di beberapa kota di Indonesia dan jumlah mobil dan motor yang dilelang terus meningkat. Dengan perkembangan yang semakin pesat pada tahun 2019 ASLC meng-akuisisi 51% saham JBA, yang merupakan salah satu big player dalam bisnis lelang kendaraan di Indonesia. Melalui akuisisi tersebut Bidwin melebur dengan JBA menjadi JBA Indonesia. JBA berkembang pesat hingga pada tahun 2020 memiliki jumlah average buyer 30,000 per tahun, auction success rate diatas 90% dan market share sebesar 40%.\r\n\r\nASLC juga memiliki layanan jual beli mobil online to offline di bawah brand \"CAROLINE.id\". Melalui layanan ini, pelanggan dapat membeli atau menjual kendaraan dengan lebih mudah dan aman. Semua kendaraan yang diperjualbelikan akan melalui proses inspeksi kendaraan, penilaian harga yang akurat dan dilengkapi dengan garansi kendaraan.\r\n\r\nASLC terus berinovasi demi menciptakan ekosistem jual beli mobil yang lengkap dengan mengembangkan \"CARTALOG\", situs penyedia informasi harga kendaraan satu-satunya di Indonesia. Situs ini dibekali dengan teknologi Artificial Intelligence yang memberikan informasi secara akurat dan terpercaya.","history":{"amount":"653 B","board":"Papan Pengembangan","date":"25 Jan 2022","price":"256","registrar":"","shares":"2,549,271,000","underwriters":["Ciptadana Sekuritas Asia","Trimegah Sekuritas Indonesia Tbk."],"administrative_bureau":"PT Raya Saham Registra","free_float":"18.59%"},"key_executive":{"commissioner":[{"id":"29599717","key":"Commissioner","lastupdate":"2026-05-21T20:44:22+07:00","value":"DRS. PRODJO SUNARJANTO SEKAR PANTJAWATI"}],"director":[{"id":"29599716","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2026-05-21T20:44:22+07:00","value":"ARMEZA FARHANSYAH UMAR"},{"id":"29599715","key":"Director","lastupdate":"2026-05-21T20:44:22+07:00","value":"KAZUHIRO SHIOYAMA"}],"independent_commissioner":[{"id":"29599719","key":"Commissioner (Independent)","lastupdate":"2026-05-21T20:44:22+07:00","value":"SELVY MONALISA"}],"president_commissioner":[{"id":"29599718","key":"President Commissioner","lastupdate":"2026-05-21T20:44:22+07:00","value":"ERIDA"}],"president_director":[{"id":"29599714","key":"President Director","lastupdate":"2026-05-21T20:44:22+07:00","value":"JANY CANDRA"}],"vice_president":[],"vice_president_commissioner":[],"independent_vice_president_commissioner":[],"independent_president_commissioner":[]},"secretary":[{"id":"12537611","key":"","lastupdate":"2022-01-25T09:10:09+07:00","value":"{\"name\":\"Andrew Pratama Lazaro\",\"phone\":\"(021) 6530 8811\",\"email\":\"corporate.secretary@autopedia.id\"}"}],"shareholder":[{"percentage":"77.6%","name":"PT ADI SARANA ARMADA TBK","value":"9.89 B","badges":["pengendali"],"id":"0","type":"","location":"","nationality":"","domicile":"","scripless":"","scrip":"","value_formatted":"","classification":""},{"percentage":"19.2%","name":"MASYARAKAT NON WARKAT","value":"2.45 B","badges":[],"id":"0","type":"","location":"","nationality":"","domicile":"","scripless":"","scrip":"","value_formatted":"","classification":""},{"percentage":"0.5%","name":"SAHAM TREASURY","value